  "day": "Agents ask before they break things, pick the right model for each task, and every machine is up to date when you start.",
  "cost": "Nothing to set up: every Fleet machine gets it.",
  "risk": "Fleet owns its hooks in Claude Code and Codex. A hook you wrote yourself on the same event is kept until you adopt Fleet's.",
  "instructions": "AGENTS.md",
